          "type": "text",
          "content": "",
          "font": "Wingdings3",
          "size": 16.0,
          "is_latex": false
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "content": "Given this value function, eliminating noise words would save the",
          "font": "TrebuchetMS",
          "size": 20.0,
          "is_latex": false
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "content": "company $24,000 per year, calculated as:",
          "font": "TrebuchetMS",
          "size": 20.0,
          "is_latex": false
        },
        {
          "type": "math_formula",
          "content": "(72 requests/second - 60 requests/second) * $2000/year = $24,000/year",
          "font": "TrebuchetMS-Bold",
          "size": 18.0,
          "is_latex": true
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "content": "",
          "font": "Wingdings3",
          "size": 16.0,
          "is_latex": false
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "content": "Adding a second server would save the company $110,000 per year,",
          "font": "TrebuchetMS",
          "size": 20.0,
          "is_latex": false
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "content": "calculated as:",
          "font": "TrebuchetMS",
          "size": 20.0,
          "is_latex": false
        },
        {
          "type": "math_formula",
          "content": "(115 requests/second - 60 requests/second) * $2000/year = $110,000/year",
          "font": "TrebuchetMS-Bold",
          "size": 18.0,
          "is_latex": true
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "content": "",
          "font": "Wingdings3",
          "size": 16.0,
          "is_latex": false
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "content": "The second design option would improve the system’s throughput beyond",
          "font": "TrebuchetMS",
          "size": 20.0,
          "is_latex": false
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "content": "what will be needed (the system will receive at most 200 requests per",
          "font": "TrebuchetMS",
          "size": 20.0,
          "is_latex": false
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "content": "second).Therefore, the value added by changing to bin-based indexing is",
          "font": "TrebuchetMS",
          "size": 20.1,
          "is_latex": false
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "content": "the maximum possible value:",
          "font": "TrebuchetMS",
          "size": 20.0,
          "is_latex": false
        },
        {
          "type": "math_formula",
          "content": "(200 requests/second - 60 requests/second) * $2000/year = $280,000/year",
          "font": "TrebuchetMS-Bold",
          "size": 18.0,
          "is_latex": true
        }
